    40	| access-missing | Stop and ask for missing access/tool facts | yes |
    41	| write-safety-required | Stop before mutation; ask for write safety and confirmation | yes |
    42	| human-decision-required | Stop and ask for decision | yes |
    43	| contract-insufficient | Repair contract before execution | maybe |
    44	| external-system-unsafe | Allow bounded observation only | maybe |
    45	| unknown | Ask for facts needed to classify | yes |
